tore/yj1wxm9hh8610iyzqnz75kvs6xl8j3my-source' from 'https://cache.numtide.com'...\ncopying path '/nix/store/mhmv0p4sqvfxsyxx58y6qx9zqfzyas1w-stdenv-linux' from 'https://cache.nixos.org'...\ncopying path '/nix/store/g14fri80i39za36cqhi5pxrprnwp0kaj-git-minimal-2.54.0' from 'https://cache.numtide.com'...\nbuilding '/nix/store/qwliajv86iyxlja8vxil4rzvd6qvkk83-dev-workspace-coordination.json.drv'...\nbuilding '/nix/store/qn2w0s9v7cd48z15x6n5pm20hqs7g6ly-dev-workspace-extensions.json.drv'...\nbuilding '/nix/store/s62adhm9cifmasmbf6jjg4pvda5dcqvr-dev-workspace-0.2.0-go-modules.drv'...\nbuilding '/nix/store/gspgdy8qbrc0g9cndl0bzxgq8519sjrz-dev-workspace-0.2.0-env.drv'...\n✔ failed reads retain reservations, refreshed cards inherit badges, and confirmed release removes them (7.05092ms)\n✔ hidden and navigated pages abort reads and reject late responses from an earlier page lifetime (6.54572ms)\n✔ Operations preserves active-first history and keeps its successful display after a failed refresh (7.001707ms)\nℹ tests 3\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 3\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 216.626511\nRun options: -n /portal_badges/ --seed 43847\n\n# Running:\n\n...\n\nFinished in 0.952955s, 3.1481 runs/s, 28.3329 assertions/s.\n\n3 runs, 27 assertions, 0 failures, 0 errors, 0 skips\nok  \tgithub.com/aither64/dev-workspace/portal/internal/web\t0.081s\ndeployment contract passed for vpsfree-cz.workspace.aitherdev.int.vpsfree.cz at fbbffee68b586c10070da86508a4a47360ca47ed\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
